          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.090:block:2",
          "start": 157
        },
        "quote": "(b) Fail to report immediately to the Police Department any violations of City, State or Federal laws which constitute felonies or breach of the peace coming to the licensee’s attention; provided, this subsection shall not apply to those violations coming to the attention of the licensee while on the client’s business which the client does not wish to pursue.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.090:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
