          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.090:block:3",
          "start": 519
        },
        "quote": "(c) Fail to notify the Police Department of any arrests and to fail to turn such arrested person over to the Police Department; provided, that the licensee, upon refusal of the Police Department to take custody of the subject, may turn the individual over to any competent law enforcement agency.",
